          "book": "1CH",
          "chapter": 12,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "Now these are those who came to David to Ziklag while he was a fugitive from Saul the son of Kish. They were among the mighty men, his helpers in war.",
      "ko": "다윗이 기스의 아들 사울을 인하여 시글락에 숨어 있을 때에 그에게 와서 싸움을 돕는 용사 중에 든 자가 있었으니",
      "source_text_hash": "de31bb667a0f6dc4618d2570a80f668f17affe1807083abd6a68f43d7705fac3",
      "translation_text_hash": "7a7221534c0b701aadc1fa3f18b984c4feea3df6078229e49079e7a7026edc2f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
